<%# The captcha widget: rendered when the visitor has to solve one, and when they already have
    (`locals.captcha.solved`, decided in be/server.js after the staff session is known) - then it
    only says so, because one solve covers `config.captcha.sessionMinutes`.
    The picture itself is fetched by public/js/captcha.js (so a page with a form does not
    generate a puzzle for every reader), one challenge for the whole page, and solving it leaves
    a cookie behind - the answer never travels with the post. The guard lives here, so both forms
    can include it blindly.
    The puzzle is closed until the reader opens it, which the script does (`captcha-collapsed`);
    without it the markup is simply open, which is what a reader who cannot solve it anyway
    would see. %>
<% if (locals.captcha && (locals.captcha.required || locals.captcha.solved)) { %>
<div class="captcha<%= locals.captcha.solved ? ' captcha-verified' : '' %>" data-captcha data-verified="<%= locals.captcha.solved ? 1 : 0 %>">
  <p class="captcha-verified-line"><span class="captcha-tick" aria-hidden="true">&#10004;</span> Verified &mdash; you can post.</p>
  <% if (locals.captcha.required) { %>
  <p class="captcha-actions captcha-actions-open"><button type="button" class="captcha-open">Solve the captcha</button></p>
  <div class="captcha-puzzle">
    <p class="captcha-title">Not a robot? Name the character in the picture.</p>
    <img class="captcha-image" alt="captcha" />
    <p class="captcha-controls">
      <input type="text" class="input-text captcha-answer" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="Character name" />
      <button type="button" class="captcha-check">Check</button>
      <button type="button" class="captcha-refresh" title="Another picture">&#8635;</button>
    </p>
    <p class="captcha-message">Loading a picture&hellip;</p>
    <noscript><p class="captcha-message captcha-bad">The captcha needs JavaScript - without it you cannot post while it is on.</p></noscript>
  </div>
  <p class="captcha-actions captcha-actions-hide"><button type="button" class="captcha-hide">Hide the captcha</button></p>
  <% } %>
</div>
<% } %>
